<title>UK: Pakistan buys 6,000 tonnes RBD palm oil - trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys 6,000 tonnes RBD palm oil - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's state-run Trading Corporation of Pakistan (TCP) bought 6,000 tonnes of RBD palm oil at $545.90 a tonne c and f for shipment by December 31, at its tender on Thursday, European vegetable oil traders said. --Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
